=9CBuy For Me=E2=80=9D and =E2=80=9CRufus,=E2=80=9D Perplexity with Comet.

For now, Amazon=E2=80=99s drawing the line around its data, while Perplexit=
y=E2=80=99s betting on user autonomy as the future of browsing. One side ca=
lls it security, the other calls it control. It=E2=80=99ll be interesting t=
o see how cases like this shape the next era of web browsing and online sho=
pping.

