></h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, san=
s-serif; font-size: 16px;">Starting this month, millions of Indians are get=
ting a year of free access to ChatGPT=E2=80=99s new =E2=80=9CGo=E2=80=9D ch=
atbot. This came after similar offers from Google and Perplexity AI. Each h=
as partnered with India=E2=80=99s largest telecoms (Reliance Jio, Airtel) t=
o bundle AI access into data plans.</span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, san=
s-serif; font-size: 16px;">At first glance, it looks generous. However, acc=
ording to analysts, it=E2=80=99s a strategic land grab:</span></p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"=
>India has 900+ million internet users, most of whom are under 24.</span></=
li>
<li><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"=
>It=E2=80=99s an open market, unlike China=E2=80=99s tightly regulated tech=
 space.</span></li>
<li><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"=
>Every =E2=80=9Cfree=E2=80=9D chat is first-hand data feeding global AI mod=
els.</span></li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, san=
s-serif; font-size: 16px;">The playbook feels familiar: hook users early, t=
hen monetize the habit. Analysts call it a =E2=80=9Ccalculated investment i=
n India=E2=80=99s digital future,=E2=80=9D with data and engagement as the =
real currencies.</span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:175%"><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, san=
s-serif; font-size: 16px;">The catch? India still lacks a full AI governanc=
e law. The Digital Personal Data Protection Act (DPDP) is in place but not =
yet enforced. Until it is, global AI firms can experiment freely at a natio=
nal scale =E2=80=94 a regulatory gray zone that might soon tighten.</span><=
/p>
