I-generated visuals, blending creative artistry with near-professional poli=
sh and 4K capabilities.</span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, san=
s-serif; font-size: 16px;">The hype centers on what people are calling =E2=
=80=9Cthe Photoshop killer=E2=80=9D:</span></p>
