>Scene composition magic=D6=89 models can now assemble complex multi-charac=
ter or landscape shots in layers, not just single prompts.</span></li>
<li><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"=
>Workflow-level intelligence=D6=89 Nano Banana 2 doesn=E2=80=99t just gener=
ate; it plans, checks, and fixes its own outputs in multi-step cycles.</spa=
n></li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-family: Lato, Tahoma, san=
s-serif; font-size: 16px;">Screenshots of photorealistic landscapes, redesi=
gned neon cities, hyper-detailed character art, and even pinball machine la=
